      "status": "generated",
      "prompt": "Edit the supplied source photograph into Abstract Scene Concept Poster / 抽象景物概念海报. Produce one complete portrait 3:4 image, at least 1086 by 1448 pixels.\nObserved source: 白石墙红瓦房舍沿石阶层叠，石阶由下方中央通入村落；高挑柏树集中左侧和中部，右侧有宽冠绿树，后方蓝海、低山与晴空清楚，保有建筑遮挡和道路方向，无人物文字。\nMedium: A photo-and-illustration sheet where scene-specific geometric masses and loose linear accents preserve the source’s spatial rhythm.\nCreate one portrait 3:4 sheet on pale cream paper, with the complete original photograph above a source-derived abstract scene.\nFit the photograph without stretching or removing key structures; keep a calm paper gap between the two representations.\nExtract houses, roofs, tall trees, broad crowns, paths and sea into simplified connected masses specific to the photographed scene.\nLimit the lower drawing to source-derived terracotta, green, blue and paper tones, with mostly flat opaque color.\nPreserve near-to-far ordering and the route through the scene; simplify perspective without replacing the place with generic geometry.\nAdd a few loose pencil-like lines for branches, steps and roof divisions; avoid tracing every photographic edge.\nUse gentle dry pigment gaps and irregular hand-cut color boundaries, keeping large masses calm and readable.\nLet the lower scene breathe into the surrounding paper with open edges, rather than filling another photographic rectangle.\nOmit new landmarks, unrelated symbols, decorative stamps, captions, invented travel facts and watermarks.\nPreserve: Keep the upper source photograph intact and recognizable. Preserve the lower scene’s major buildings, vegetation masses, path connections and shoreline direction. Simplification may compress depth and omit small details, but must not substitute unrelated visual symbols or imaginary architecture.\nAvoid: A full photographic filter, precise vector tracing, random abstract shapes or an unrelated imaginary town. Changing the source route, adding boats or landmarks, dense textures, fake postal marks, promotional captions or watermarks.\nReturn only the finished image.",
      "prompt_sha256": "078cc9b2ee613ece5ac515a1f29e80004ace295613b414f3dd63da61f45b799d",
      "prompt_redacted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-11-13T16:04:34.657Z",
